---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import smilingPhoto from "../../assets/photos/nazar-smiling.jpg";
const jsonld = [
 {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
   {
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "How much do I need for a down payment?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "It depends on the loan. Some programs allow a small down payment, and Minnesota has first-time buyer and down payment assistance programs worth asking a lender about. You'll also need cash for closing costs and a cushion for first-year repairs. Here is the full checklist."
    }
   },
   {
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "How long does it take to buy a house?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Finding the house can take one weekend or a few months. From accepted offer to closing often runs about 30 to 45 days with a mortgage. Cash can be faster."
    }
   },
   {
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "Do I need a home inspection?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Yes. It's your best look at the house before you're committed. I'm there for it, and we sort the report into real problems and routine maintenance before deciding what to ask for."
    }
   },
   {
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "Do you work outside the west metro?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Yes. Most of my home sales are in the west and southwest metro, and I work anywhere in Minnesota."
    }
   },
   {
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "Can we work in Ukrainian or Russian?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "Yes. I speak English, Ukrainian and Russian, and I can explain the contract, inspection and loan steps in any of them."
    }
   }
  ]
 }
];
---
<Base title={"Buy a Home in the West Metro | Nazar Orishchin"} description={"Buying a home in Chaska, Chanhassen, Eden Prairie or the west metro. An engineer-trained agent who checks comps, condition and disclosures before you offer."} lang="en" active="/buy/" jsonld={jsonld}>
<div class="wrap page-hero split">
<div class="stack lg"><p class="label">Buying a home</p><h1>Buy the right house at the right price.</h1>
<p class="lead">You get an agent who reads the disclosures, checks the comps, and tells you when to walk away. First home or fifth, the process is the same and I explain each step.</p>
<div class="cta"><a class="btn primary" href="https://nazarorishchin.teamsteadyrealestate.com/listing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Search homes for sale</a><a class="arrow" href="/book/">Or book a 15-min call</a></div></div>
<div class="photo"><Picture src={smilingPhoto} alt="Nazar Orishchin standing by a window" widths={[400, 640, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 460px" formats={["avif", "webp"]} loading="lazy" /></div>
</div>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap section split">
<div class="stack"><h2>How buying works</h2><p class="soft">Seven steps, in order.</p></div>
<ol class="steps">
<li><div><h3>Lender and budget</h3><p>Get pre-approved so you know your payment and sellers take your offer seriously.</p></div></li>
<li><div><h3>The list</h3><p>We agree on must-haves, towns and price range before the first showing.</p></div></li>
<li><div><h3>Showings</h3><p>I point out roof and furnace age, signs of water, and anything that will cost you later.</p></div></li>
<li><div><h3>Offer</h3><p>Price backed by recent sales, with terms built for how much competition the house has.</p></div></li>
<li><div><h3>Inspection</h3><p>We sort the report into real problems and routine maintenance, then ask the seller for what matters.</p></div></li>
<li><div><h3>Appraisal and loan</h3><p>I keep the lender, title company and seller's agent on schedule.</p></div></li>
<li><div><h3>Closing</h3><p>Final walkthrough, sign, keys. I stay available after.</p></div></li>
</ol>
</div></section>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap section stack lg">
<h2>What you get from an engineer</h2>
<div class="grid g2">
<div class="card"><h3>A read on condition</h3><p class="soft">I'm handy and I know what repairs take. You hear the realistic cost before you fall for the kitchen.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>A price with reasons</h3><p class="soft">Every offer number comes from comparable sales, adjusted for condition, with the math shown. If a house is overpriced or has a problem, I say so, even when it means more showings.</p></div>
</div>
<figure class="pull"><blockquote>“From day one, Nazar made everything feel simple, organized, and stress-free. He patiently answered every question, explained every step, and made sure we always knew what to expect.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Pavlo Fursyak</b> · Google review</figcaption></figure>
<a class="arrow" href="/blog/buying-your-first-home-in-minnesota/">Read: buying a home, start to finish</a>
<a class="arrow" href="/blog/how-to-win-a-multiple-offer-situation/">Read: winning when there are multiple offers</a>
</div></section>
<section class="rule"><div class="wrap section split faq">
<h2>Common questions</h2>
<div>
<details><summary>How much do I need for a down payment?</summary><p>It depends on the loan. Some programs allow a small down payment, and Minnesota has first-time buyer and down payment assistance programs worth asking a lender about. You'll also need cash for closing costs and a cushion for first-year repairs. <a href="/blog/your-first-step-before-buying-a-home/">Here is the full checklist.</a></p></details>
<details><summary>How long does it take to buy a house?</summary><p>Finding the house can take one weekend or a few months. From accepted offer to closing often runs about 30 to 45 days with a mortgage. Cash can be faster.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do I need a home inspection?</summary><p>Yes. It's your best look at the house before you're committed. I'm there for it, and we sort the report into real problems and routine maintenance before deciding what to ask for.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you work outside the west metro?</summary><p>Yes. Most of my home sales are in the west and southwest metro, and I work anywhere in Minnesota.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can we work in Ukrainian?</summary><p>Yes. I speak English, Ukrainian and Russian, and I can explain the contract, inspection and loan steps in any of them.</p></details>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap section tight band-grid">
<div class="stack"><p class="label">Next step</p><h2>Let's find your house.</h2><p class="soft">A short call to set your budget, towns and must-haves. Then I'll send you homes the day they list.</p></div>
<div class="stack" style="align-items:flex-start"><a class="btn primary" href="/book/">Book a 15-min call</a>
<a class="arrow light" href="mailto:Nazar@ts-re.com">Or email Nazar@ts-re.com</a></div>
</div></section>
</Base>
